ers/asapehrsson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asapehrsson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asapehrsson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asapehrsson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asapehrsson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asapehrsson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-09-26T08:54:15Z","updated_at":"2016-09-26T08:54:15Z","body":"I have the same problem.\n\nMy workaround: Modify MergingMediaPeriod.java, MergingMediaSource.java and SingleSampleMediaPeriod.java.\n\nFirst, change MergingMediaPeriod.java line 175.\n\n```\nif (--pendingChildPrepareCount > 0) {\n```\n\nto\n\n```\nif (pendingChildPrepareCount-- > 0) {\n```\n\nThen add code, MergingMediaSource.java, line 121\n\n```\nfor (int i = 0; i < periods.length; i++) {\n     periods[i] = mediaSources[i].createPeriod(index, mergingPeriod, allocator, positionUs);\n    Assertions.checkState(periods[i] != null, \"Child source must not return null period\");\n}\nmergingPeriod.onPrepared(null); //added this line\n```\n\nFinally initialize sampleData in SingleSampleMediaPeriod.java\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/249514871/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"asapehrsson","id":1550513,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTA1MTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1550513?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asapehrsson","html_url":"https://github.com/asapehrsson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asapehrsson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asapehrsson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asapehrsson/gists{/gist_i